  "notes": "Interim 100-card mono-red Commander deck for the Foundations Reign of Dragons precon (official list unreleased; Ruling M3-P). Commanded by Lathliss, Dragon Queen: every nontoken Dragon ETB makes a 5/5 flying Dragon, so the deck is eighteen Dragons plus Dragon-cost reducers and Goblin token makers (Hordeling Outburst, Krenko's Command, Siege-Gang Commander) to keep the board wide. Burn is red's classic suite (Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning, Incinerate, Flame Slash and friends), draw comes from Faithless Looting/Thrill of Possibility/Tormenting Voice plus Reforge the Soul, and the top end (Balefire Dragon, Utvara Hellkite, Moonveil Dragon) closes through the air. Colour identity is exactly red: every non-Mountain land and artifact is colourless-identity (Kher Keep, Ancient Tomb, Sol Ring family), and no card carries a coloured symbol outside red.",
